{"root":"pegang","ipa":"/pəɡaŋ/","core":"用手握住、拿住或控制某物，引申为掌握、把持或担任职务。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pəɡaŋ/","zh":"握，拿，抓，把持","phrases":[{"t":"pegang tangan","zh":"牵手"},{"t":"pegang kendali","zh":"掌握控制权"},{"t":"pegang janji","zh":"守承诺"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memegang erat tangan ibunya.","zh":"他紧紧地握住母亲的手。"},{"t":"Jangan pegang barang itu sembarangan.","zh":"不要随便乱碰那个东西。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"pegang","ipa":"/pəɡaŋ/","zh":"握住","phrase":{"t":"pegang erat","zh":"紧握"},"example":{"t":"Pegang tali ini kuat-kuat.","zh":"把这条绳子抓紧。"}},{"w":"memegang","ipa":"/məməɡaŋ/","zh":"拿着，担任，控制","phrase":{"t":"memegang jabatan","zh":"担任职务"},"example":{"t":"Dia memegang peranan penting dalam proyek ini.","zh":"他在这个项目中担任重要角色。"}},{"w":"dipegang","ipa":"/dipəɡaŋ/","zh":"被握住，被掌握","phrase":{"t":"dipegang teguh","zh":"被坚定地坚持"},"example":{"t":"Prinsip itu harus dipegang teguh.","zh":"那个原则必须被坚定地坚持。"}},{"w":"pegangan","ipa":"/pəɡaŋan/","zh":"把手，扶手，依靠","phrase":{"t":"pegangan tangga","zh":"楼梯扶手"},"example":{"t":"Gunakan pegangan tangga saat naik.","zh":"上楼时请使用扶手。"}},{"w":"pemegang","ipa":"/pəməɡaŋ/","zh":"持有者，握持者","phrase":{"t":"pemegang saham","zh":"股东"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah pemegang rekor dunia.","zh":"他是世界纪录的保持者。"}}],"derSlugs":["pegang","memegang","dipegang","pegangan","pemegang"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:48:28.135Z","src":"base"}